lesome character formation.\\n\\nApproved by AICTE and affiliated with the Directorate of Technical Education (DOTE), Tamil Nadu, the institute provides specialized diploma courses in engineering disciplines. The campus integrates rigorous academic instruction with hands-on workshop training, moral guidance, and life-coping skills to ensure that graduates emerge as competent professionals and socially conscious individuals.\\n\\nEquipped with advanced laboratories, comprehensive libraries, active placement cells, and supportive residential facilities, Don Bosco Polytechnic College continues to be a beacon of hope and technical excellence for marginalized communities along the Tamil Nadu coastline.","highlights":["Run by the globally renowned Salesians of Don Bosco network","Strong emphasis on value-based technical education and discipline","Approved by AICTE and affiliated with DOTE Chennai","Dedicated placement and career guidance cell","Well-maintained infrastructure with specialized engineering labs","Active technical and soft-skill development programs","Supportive hostel facilities for boys and girls","Rich tradition of community service and leadership development","Regular industrial visits and vocational training camps","Holistic campus atmosphere promoting sports and arts"],"departments":[{"name":"Mechanical Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Electrical and Electronics Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Civil Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Electronics and Communication Engineering","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","n