ls.\\n\\nOver the years, Pothigai Polytechnic College has built a strong reputation for academic rigor and holistic development. The institution emphasizes practical training, technical skill workshops, and personality development programs to ensure students are industry-ready upon graduation. With a dedicated placement cell, the college maintains active ties with leading manufacturing and IT industries.\\n\\nThe serene and conducive learning environment enables students to thrive academically and culturally. Through state-of-the-art facilities, structured mentoring, and affordable fee structures, Pothigai Polytechnic College continues to empower rural and urban youth, fostering a culture of innovation, leadership, and lifelong learning.","highlights":["Approved by AICTE and affiliated with DOTE, Chennai","State-of-the-art laboratory facilities for hands-on training","Experienced and dedicated faculty members","Active placement cell with strong industry linkages","Comprehensive library with extensive technical journals","Separate hostel facilities for boys and girls","Regular industrial visits and technical symposia","Focus on soft skills and communication training","Scholarship assistance for eligible students","Vibrant campus life with cultural and sports events"],"departments":[{"name":"Mechanical Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Civil Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Electrical and Electronics Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Electronics and Communication Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Computer Engineering","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell