 Chennai","accreditation":["AICTE","DOTE","Govt of Tamil Nadu"],"about":"Bharathiyar Centenary Memorial Government Women''s Polytechnic College is situated in Ettayapuram, the historic birthplace of the legendary poet Mahakavi Subramania Bharathiyar. Established in 1982, the institution serves as a vital center for imparting technical education to women in the Thoothukudi district. The college is dedicated to nurturing technical skills, fostering leadership qualities, and promoting self-reliance among students.\\n\\nThe sprawling campus provides specialized labs, workshops, a well-stocked library, and computing facilities. Dedicated faculty members mentor students through comprehensive curricula and practical sessions. The active placement and training cell coordinates with regional industries to ensure students secure rewarding career pathways upon graduation.","highlights":["Located in the historic town of Ettayapuram","Established in 1982 honoring Mahakavi Bharathiyar","AICTE approved and DOTE affiliated","Dedicated technical training for rural women","Spacious campus with modern laboratories","Active placement cell with industry tie-ups","On-campus hostel accommodation","Strong emphasis on practical skill development","Engaging NSS and cultural activities","Affordable government fee structure"],"departments":[{"name":"Civil Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Computer Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Electrical and Electronics Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Electronics and Communication Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"Modern Office Practice","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":